                               via 10.2.2.0, Ethernet2
 O        10.6.0.0/16 [110/30] via 10.2.1.0, Ethernet1
                               via 10.2.2.0, Ethernet2
 O        10.7.0.0/16 [110/30] via 10.2.1.0, Ethernet1
                               via 10.2.2.0, Ethernet2

